    "created_at": "2019-02-13T04:00:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-02-13T04:00:29Z",
    "body": "On macOS, form controls are not focusable. See https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focusable-area\r\n\r\nThe last row in the table which says: \"[a]ny other element or part of an element, especially to aid with accessibility or to better match platform conventions\" does not include form controls on macOS.\r\n",
