    "updated_at": "2024-06-30T17:38:36Z",
    "body": "Hello, I seem to be getting different results in the latest version of MacOS. Chrome and Firefox only fire the click event, when clicking the focused checkbox. No blur event is fired after the checkbox has received focused and is clicked. Perhaps something has changed in MacOS?\r\n\r\nCheers",
